WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:02,180
I just sent away the bastards from Sakura Country

2
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:03,780
The beautiful country is here again

3
00:00:03,780 --> 00:00:05,180
So annoying

4
00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:06,580
an ordinary person

5
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:09,100
