10
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,100
Annoying blood

11
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:22,320
Not as delicious though

12
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:24,750
But it’s worth tasting

13
00:00:24,750 --> 00:00:25,950
Dragon people

14
00:00:25,950 --> 00:00:28,150
I really don’t know how high the sky is and how high it is

15
00:00:28,750 --> 00:00:30,660
an ordinary person

16
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:34,020
How dare you point fingers at us?

17
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:35,820
Just let me take you on your way
